# Worksheet

**F1 – Core loop:** Single `S` object; `rnd(S)` mulberry32 keyed off `S.rngState`; `resolveTurn()` runs 9 fixed steps (storm→prod→overflow→needs→morale→market→event→arrivals→end). Score 2.

**F2 – Map:** `GRID=8`; `genTerrain(S)` uses `rnd(S)`; `placeError()` checks `b.terr.includes(S.tiles[i])`; `adjFlat`/`outMul` read `countAdj()` and feed `projectBuilding()`'s real output. Score 2.

**F3 – Economy:** Chains ash→soil (composter), soil+water→food (greenhouse), ore→metal (forge); `capOf()` caps enforced; overflow section destroys excess and logs it. Score 2.

**F4 – Population:** `makeColonist()` gives skill/fatigue/morale/job; `effOf()` reads `c.skill`,`c.fatigue`,`c.morale`,`c.job` and feeds `buildingEff()`→production. Score 2.

**F5 – Needs:** `consumption(S)` per-turn food/water; shortfall lowers morale in section 5 (`supply` ratio); morale factors into `effOf().mor`; recovery via +3 morale when fed. Score 2.

**F6 – Research:** 12 nodes in `TECH`; `buyTech()` enforces `pre.every(has)`, deducts via `payCost`; effects read in `outMul`/`inpMul`/`capMul`/`stormMitigation`. Score 2.

**F7 – Events:** 14 entries in `EVENTS`; `fireEvent()` does weighted pick over `w`; 6+ events have 2-3 `choices` with differing `run()` effects; `evCooldown[id]=cd` decremented each turn. Score 2.

**F8 – Trade:** `priceInfo()` uses `S.market[k]` drift and stockpile `fill`; `spawnCaravan` gives finite `inv`; `tradeBuy`/`tradeSell` both mutate `S.res`/`S.caravan.inv`. Score 2.

**F9 – Hazard:** storm section fires on `S.turn>=S.storm.next`; `stormSeverity` grows with turn/count; `integrityFactor` cuts `projectBuilding` output; `windbreaks`/`stormglass` tech and `windbreak` building mitigate via `stormMitigation()`; `doRepair` spends parts. Score 2.

**F10 – Save/load:** `saveText`→JSON in textarea; `loadText` validates version/fields/terrain/jobs/buildings and throws descriptive `Error`, caught and shown in `#saveinfo`. Score 2.

**F11 – End conditions:** win/lose both in section 9 of `resolveTurn` (`pop<=0` loss, turn 60 win/lose check); `scoreOf()` combines pop/skill/tech/stock/turns; `showEnd()` renders summary modal. Score 2.

**F12 – UI:** `renderTabs()` switches `TAB`; log entries show `"T"+e.t`; extensive `dataset.tip`/`showTip`; keydown listener for space & tab-number keys; `@media(min-width:760px)` layout switch. Score 2.

**F13 – Dev panel:** `runTests()` has 30 assertions on real invariants (caps, morale/fatigue math, storm mitigation bounds, save round-trip hash); `runBenchmark()` runs `greedyTurn+resolveTurn(S,true)` headlessly, printing `stateHash`. Score 2.

**G1:** `TECH.hydrology.eff.prodMul.condenser` read in `outMul()`, multiplies `projectBuilding` output; test 13 confirms +25%. Score 4.

**G2:** `consumption()`→shortfall in section 4→`supply` ratio drives morale delta in section 5→`effOf().mor` used in `buildingEff`/production. Score 4.

**G3:** storm section calls into `S.b[i].integrity` reduction→`integrityFactor`/`scale` cuts `projectBuilding` output→`doRepair` spends `parts` and resets integrity to 1. Score 4.

**G4:** `priceInfo()` reads `S.market[k]` (drifted each turn in section 6) and `S.res[k]/capOf` fill for `stockMod`, both feeding `mid`. Score 4.

**G5:** `vein`/`strangers`/`sickness` choices call `give()`, `S.people.push`, `damageRandomBuilding`, `moraleAll` — real state writes, not just log text; test 26 checks state hash changes for every event. Score 4.

